{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34009","headline":"初冬偶作寄南阳润卿 · 皮日休","name":"初冬偶作寄南阳润卿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寓居无事入清冬，虽设樽罍酒半空。\n白菊爲霜翻带紫，苍苔因雨却成红。\n迎潮预遣收鱼笱，防雪先教盖鹤笼。\n唯待支硎最寒夜，共君披氅访林公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34009.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34009","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}